At Thu, 13 Mar 2008 10:48:49 +0800,
Jiang zhe wrote:
> 
> Hi,
> 
> According to the [0003839]
> https://bugtrack.alsa-project.org/alsa-bug/view.php?id=3839
> 
> The PCI ID of ASUS F9S is 1043:1339 and "model=lenovo" works for it.
> But I found that ASUS G1 have the same id and model is 3stack in the
> alsa driver.
> 
> Which one is true?

The question is rather which one is "better".  At the time ASUS G1
quirk was added, there was no lenovo model preset.  If lenovo preset
works better, we should take it, as the devices with the same PCI SSID
are supposed to be compatible.


Takashi


